sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Network (Godot)
    participant Server (GameController)
    participant Spawner (Server)

    Note over Client: Player clicks Grid (3,3)
    Client->>Server: RPC: RequestPlaceUnit(Cow, 3,3)
    
    Note over Server: Server_HandleSpawnRequest() runs
    Server->>Server: Validate Logic (Money/Grid)
    
    alt Valid Move
        Server->>Spawner: _unitsContainer.AddChild(NewCow)
        Note over Spawner: Detected new child!
        Spawner-->>Network (Godot): Serialize & Replicate
        Network (Godot)-->>Client: Instantiate 'Cow.tscn' at (3,3)
    else Invalid Move
        Server-->>Client: (Optional) RPC: ShowError("Not enough minerals")
    end
